model {
  extend basalt.modelGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Quota collection normalizes vendor-reported model weekly windows and active reset grant kind, scope, remaining count and expiry into the existing snapshot. A model grant never becomes a whole-week reset. Reset effects reference the same window identifiers as readings; unknown retained aggregates stay unclassified. Bounded discovery records only approved quota metadata when explicitly enabled, never credentials or raw responses. Existing stored JSON remains readable without a schema migration."
    }
  }
}
